{"term":{"label":"禮","occurrences":4,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i","title":"盡心上","description":"孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"君子","id":"君子"},{"form":"在","id":"在"},{"form":"失","id":"失"},{"form":"害","id":"害"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"性","id":"性"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"教","id":"敎"},{"form":"敬","id":"敬"},{"form":"求","id":"求"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"禮","id":"禮"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"飢","id":"飢"}],"edges":[{"weight":3.6041382256588457,"source":"飢","target":"害"},{"weight":2.1000608288825715,"source":"飢","target":"心"},{"weight":1.0296194171811581,"source":"仁","target":"求"},{"weight":0.15415067982725836,"source":"仁","target":"君子"},{"weight":0.8472978603872037,"source":"仁","target":"心"},{"weight":0.5596157879354227,"source":"仁","target":"性"},{"weight":1.540445040947149,"source":"仁","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.6582280766035324,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":1.9459101490553132,"source":"仁","target":"愛"},{"weight":2.1000608288825715,"source":"心","target":"性"},{"weight":1.8769172775683618,"source":"心","target":"敎"},{"weight":1.001448540214462,"source":"心","target":"君子"},{"weight":2.3877429013343527,"source":"心","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"心","target":"義"},{"weight":2.793208009442517,"source":"心","target":"害"},{"weight":1.1192315758708453,"source":"敬","target":"王"},{"weight":2.793208009442517,"source":"敬","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.8123787564307907,"source":"敬","target":"義"},{"weight":1.8123787564307907,"source":"敬","target":"愛"},{"weight":2.7523860149222616,"source":"在","target":"求"},{"weight":2.7523860149222616,"source":"在","target":"惡"},{"weight":2.570064458128307,"source":"在","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"